happening. I imagine a perfect Lojbanic community as a place where people
do lots of translations and projects and such. What I see is the opposite:
a place where everyone is stingy about helping, talking, writing, and
complains about it.
>> Up to this point, this email really IS a complaint; now I want to
propose something that would solve the problem. I think there should be a
place for people to volunteer to other projects. Everyone that needs help
or wants to start a community project would be welcome.
